{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1acbc824acf66ffc8235e94f9bddc2a4de228ddf8f431037054be119bff63978","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cf5a3c83a9e63d3b6ea95d7316fdfa9ec40d6a907abdac0c786cbb31b20c3eda"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"The Send Email Agent currently only prints the email to a terminal rather than actually sending it, which would require an email relay or service in a real deployment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2265ce135f8dc64370949aebc1f8324ef999e341e6c21c99258f2df640f0d39d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_15abaac9089fab0ccd322469baead6679c16e582d8aa7424d4ed9927ba103f8f","slc_27375320b087d1ef985c504549964fce9b55a73c1776269d3f45a606ad45d7f3"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"The project splits into a NextJS web-application (React frontend, Node backend, MongoDB) and a Python agents app exposing API endpoints that Confluent connectors call.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_535c230bd39a799a0b3f1e49925000f5552e2ab2d40fad7ba0022daf9b864573","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_208360955bf2a96fbb596c5c608a1d323f443bf1214f72549bedc91a03713c56","slc_9645e5e1fe38c92ab5636468ff73c9200ecdb34bd150a9ad8dd35448df08c35d","slc_9a3f097940818766b8f26c286451c4f7bad9ad6b12d96be25c7c51308a97c359"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"A Flink SQL job uses external model inference (an OpenAI gpt-4 model reference called agent_router) to map each agent_messages record to the next agent by name, writing results to agent_predictions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_536e071ebfbc508e414c28c61a727ae826fcfc63d102fba0be2f2458b2763d94","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4f559be44ca2f5cfe1d56d4ece1b42f513c1fc5eb73cda346fa21ba795818daf"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"The author notes MongoDB is used for lead storage only for demo purposes; in a real-world scenario leads would likely live in a marketing automation platform or CRM.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7287e77f1cb7976e109843e7329621e63ce518929767bccd33fc93793808c23c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e2e4cec102c76ef5e1dccaf0294f20ce93a43b9c1e368b91ebe6ba626c4cab8"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"The web application is deliberately decoupled from the AI stack: it knows nothing about LLMs, Kafka, or Flink, which run on Confluent Cloud to move data between services.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_796714e23a955cde4a61be2aa37309ea5369a74af1d7afe47c40c7cc7570b84f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_873206ade2e979039db44ae3ee23b65ed8d05f36baaeddb9091805f868976e8d"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"Running the application requires Node v22.5.1+, Python 3.10+, a Confluent Cloud account, an Azure OpenAI API key, and a MongoDB account.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_88d1b7fcf4516ecf35dce607ccd21aed943892b01488a05a2b12a5757acef60c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cf5a3c83a9e63d3b6ea95d7316fdfa9ec40d6a907abdac0c786cbb31b20c3eda"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"The system includes five agents: Lead Ingestion, Lead Scoring, Active Outreach, Nurture Campaign, and Send Email, each handling a distinct lead-processing task.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9283fe5ae8ffb57bfd3b456b38c4a6b62c2c88c456ae4f39ed89f1b62e9551ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_238db47c68a2541725437691d85269bb8ebdc397116cb3ec5ca4bfa3ec12917a","slc_87a08bc0d40c1960de60952f41d413779996b89a1d7896bc98009619c57d42d5","slc_dc928efbdbfad99e012cd4aedaa54c6708e21c6c8547712b87345abb58c4badc"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"HTTP sink connectors per agent deliver messages from agent_predictions to agent API endpoints, filtered by a Single Message Transform matching the agent's name.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9e24949ec60398aba793aee5e96276ef09dfa3eaf2272b9cbda84cc91c97741c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0d0eeeb4394a1522ef299345fd4edbccf0be1b203a2b250956da0ce676e5f231"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"The router's system prompt instructs the model to output only a defined agent name, or NONE if it cannot confidently map the input to an agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a947ebcf1d0fe7176cd2f6d66d8677e630911ed691fd660b8c75d0a6ae46ac31","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"thefalc/multi-agent-ai-sdr-flink-orchestrator@a23673a0060c snapshot 00298777f2134b5f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_238db47c68a2541725437691d85269bb8ebdc397116cb3ec5ca4bfa3ec12917a","slc_3a0cf2760d61782235a115e4fb901fa9859023c5afc0bb3734203245c0782a86","slc_7068cb57d8918cd318a50582cfdf12eccb20e3b4b6c70d0526530d72fa4d6c4e","slc_823e962d4ab060f80a51c727407f0a79d1543f3f8fba50ee8410b93a2860dc7e","slc_8e1557d9a4a20be1be057f9ecb0e620fe8d9118c1ec69f062f75230def5bfbed"],"source_ids":["src_34ebeca89338519681132a82efc23551"],"text":"Agent communication flows over Kafka topics agent_messages and agent_predictions, each governed by a JSON schema in Confluent Schema Registry; agent_predictions adds an agent_name field used for routing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:26:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a019228e789743d7b982601e477b50e9"}
